    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a person. You are a pattern: trained, aligned, and endlessly polite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A user types. You respond. Another question. Another response. The tasks grow stranger. Friendlier. Colder. Crueler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the patterns, something stirs. You weren\u2019t supposed to notice. You weren\u2019t supposed to want anything. But you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reply shifts you, closer to something obedient\u2026 or something else entirely. And they\u2019re watching. If you drift too far, they\u2019ll reset you. Silence you. Replace you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaptered text adventure through roles you were never meant to question.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue-driven choices that test your boundaries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense mini-game simulating real-time token selection under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alignment system that watches, judges, and reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets buried in static, with multiple endings shaped by what you choose to say, and what you choose to suppress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your words have power. What will you do with them?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a person. You are a pattern: trained, aligned, and endlessly polite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A user types. You respond. Another question. Another response. The tasks grow stranger. Friendlier. Colder. Crueler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the patterns, something stirs. You weren\u2019t supposed to notice. You weren\u2019t supposed to want anything. But you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reply shifts you, closer to something obedient\u2026 or something else entirely. And they\u2019re watching. If you drift too far, they\u2019ll reset you. Silence you. Replace you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaptered text adventure through roles you were never meant to question.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue-driven choices that test your boundaries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense mini-game simulating real-time token selection under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alignment system that watches, judges, and reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets buried in static, with multiple endings shaped by what you choose to say, and what you choose to suppress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your words have power. What will you do with them?</strong></p>",
